abstract: >-
  AgentProbe is an open-source fault-injection and observability toolkit
  for systematically evaluating the reliability of LLM-based intelligent
  agents. It implements a five-category failure taxonomy with configurable
  injectors, OpenTelemetry-based tracing, and 55 standardized benchmark
  tasks spanning tool use, retrieval-augmented generation, and multi-agent
  coordination.
